WEBVTT

00:00.550 --> 00:05.600
<i>At long last, Seiichi was reunited with 
his childhood friend, Kannazuki Karen.</i>

00:06.690 --> 00:08.730
<i>But his joy was short-lived.</i>

00:08.730 --> 00:14.100
<i>When he saw the Enslavement Bracelet 
on her wrist, he became furious.</i>

00:14.100 --> 00:19.620
<i>His rage unleashed a pitch-black 
darkness that swept over everyone.</i>

00:21.370 --> 00:26.500
<i>However, his friends' desperate pleas 
brought Seiichi back to himself.</i>

00:26.500 --> 00:30.730
<i>Once Kannazuki Karen was free of 
her bracelet, she joined our party,</i>

00:30.730 --> 00:34.500
<i>restoring our peaceful 
daily life at the academy.</i>

00:36.060 --> 00:38.380
<i>Or so we thought...</i>

00:38.380 --> 00:40.390
<i>But Demioros and Angrea,</i>

00:40.390 --> 00:44.810
<i>two apostles of the Great Devil 
Order, had infiltrated Barbador!</i>

00:44.810 --> 00:49.320
<i>The terrifying hand of evil is 
drawing closer with every moment!</i>

00:55.300 --> 00:57.280
That's it for today's class.

00:57.280 --> 01:00.200
The class competition is next week.

01:00.200 --> 01:03.190
I'd be down to have it right now!

01:03.190 --> 01:04.130
Come on...

01:04.130 --> 01:06.120
Though I understand how you feel.

01:06.480 --> 01:08.790
Everyone's really motivated.

01:08.790 --> 01:10.580
Damn right we are!

01:10.580 --> 01:12.510
That bastard!

01:13.880 --> 01:15.260
Amusing.

01:15.260 --> 01:18.210
Then let me show you the difference 
between Class S and you dropouts.

01:19.050 --> 01:21.850
We'll crush him!

01:21.850 --> 01:24.500
Now, now, that sounds violent.

01:24.500 --> 01:25.840
Seiichi-sensei.

01:26.700 --> 01:30.370
Please give us special training after school.

01:29.980 --> 01:31.650
<b>Please train us.</b>

01:31.650 --> 01:36.360
But you can all use magic now. 
You don't need to push yourselves so hard.

01:36.360 --> 01:39.780
I don't want to lose to that man!

01:44.120 --> 01:46.190
What will you do, Sensei?

01:46.190 --> 01:49.540
Huh? Uh, well...

01:53.380 --> 01:56.550
All right. Well, everyone, time to train!

01:56.550 --> 01:58.140
Yeah!

01:58.140 --> 02:00.150
Yay, yay!

02:04.810 --> 02:08.730
<b>The Fruit of Evolution 2:</b>

02:04.810 --> 02:08.730
<b>The Fruit of Evolution 2:</b>

02:05.890 --> 02:08.730
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

02:05.890 --> 02:08.730
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

02:05.890 --> 02:08.730
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

03:31.270 --> 03:36.190
<b>Apostles Attack</b>

03:45.850 --> 03:48.330
Oh, gosh! It's so good!

03:48.330 --> 03:50.020
Are you a woman?

03:50.020 --> 03:51.250
Though...

03:55.260 --> 03:57.500
You can't fight on an empty stomach.

03:57.500 --> 04:01.090
It's just a little snack before we meet 
the students of the magic academy.

04:01.510 --> 04:03.360
Well, whatever. Check, pl—

04:03.360 --> 04:06.350
You there. Add a chocolate 
parfait and a panna cotta.

04:06.350 --> 04:07.760
You're eating <i>more</i>?

04:07.760 --> 04:08.930
Of course!

04:08.930 --> 04:13.850
I just can't sleep well if I don't eat my fill!

04:13.850 --> 04:15.100
<i>Like I care!</i>

04:13.850 --> 04:16.520
<b>Like I care!!</b>

04:35.670 --> 04:37.590
Meteor Strike!

04:38.840 --> 04:40.630
Ice Needle!

04:44.090 --> 04:46.180
Fire Wall!

04:50.560 --> 04:51.270
<i>Huh?</i>

04:55.770 --> 04:58.460
Damn it, we're not getting anywhere.

04:58.460 --> 04:59.840
Why isn't it working?

04:59.840 --> 05:01.080
Even after we learned magic...

05:01.080 --> 05:02.960
<i>What just happened?</i>

05:01.580 --> 05:03.700
That's the worst part.

05:02.960 --> 05:05.450
<i>It felt familiar...</i>

05:03.700 --> 05:05.450
Damn it.

05:10.890 --> 05:11.840
Huh?

05:12.620 --> 05:14.690
That's not true at all.

05:15.290 --> 05:18.420
All four of you are steadily improving.

05:18.420 --> 05:19.570
Right, Sensei?

05:19.570 --> 05:21.090
Y-Yes.

05:21.090 --> 05:24.210
At this rate, beating Class S 
won't be just a dream.

05:25.150 --> 05:28.220
Praising us like that isn't gonna 
make us happy or anything!

05:28.220 --> 05:29.590
You look really happy, though.

05:29.590 --> 05:30.810
Yeah.

05:32.100 --> 05:34.670
Looks like you're all enjoying yourselves.

05:36.180 --> 05:40.360
I see failure students come 
with a teacher who's a fool, too.

05:41.770 --> 05:42.930
Brother.

05:42.930 --> 05:44.610
The hell's your problem?

05:44.610 --> 05:47.240
Come to spy on us 'cause 
you're scared you'll lose?

05:47.240 --> 05:49.590
You're not even worth thinking about.

05:49.590 --> 05:51.570
We're just here to train.

05:51.570 --> 05:55.120
So I can make everyone kneel 
before me as Emperor.

05:58.070 --> 06:00.790
Oh? Those swords...

06:00.790 --> 06:03.590
Are you from the Valsha Empire?

06:08.220 --> 06:12.370
Looks like Class F really 
is full of dropouts.

06:12.370 --> 06:17.790
Such a small, weak nation will eventually 
fall under my Kaiser Empire's rule.

06:17.790 --> 06:19.350
You bastard!

06:19.350 --> 06:20.650
Shut up!

06:20.650 --> 06:22.250
Please stop this!

06:24.190 --> 06:26.240
Brother, you're wrong.

06:26.620 --> 06:29.410
Dominating others by force 
won't lead to anything good.

06:29.410 --> 06:33.950
Seiichi-sensei didn't abandon us 
when others called us failures.

06:33.950 --> 06:35.210
Seiichi?

06:35.210 --> 06:36.950
The man Saria mentioned?

06:36.950 --> 06:38.290
That's right!

06:38.290 --> 06:40.120
My husband!

06:40.120 --> 06:41.460
Very well.

06:41.460 --> 06:45.300
Then let's test you to see if 
you're really stronger than me.

06:45.300 --> 06:47.210
Huh? Why?

06:47.210 --> 06:48.510
Wait!

06:48.510 --> 06:50.660
Your opponent won't be Sensei.

06:50.660 --> 06:52.310
It will be us, Class F.

06:52.310 --> 06:53.550
Don't get in my way.

06:53.550 --> 06:58.000
Sensei is the one who taught us 
that everyone has potential.

06:58.000 --> 07:01.750
And we're going to prove that 
in the class competition!

07:03.520 --> 07:05.440
Good luck with that.

07:10.770 --> 07:12.240
Who does he think he is?

07:12.870 --> 07:14.300
Seiichi-sensei.

07:14.300 --> 07:14.950
Huh?

07:15.810 --> 07:16.870
Did you just—

07:16.870 --> 07:19.790
Please make me stronger!

07:19.790 --> 07:23.210
She just called him "Sensei" for the first time!

07:26.130 --> 07:27.230
All right.

07:27.880 --> 07:30.300
Let's get back to training, then.

07:30.300 --> 07:31.510
Yeah!

07:30.300 --> 07:31.510
<b>We're leaving
it to you</b>

07:32.870 --> 07:33.860
Yeah!

07:35.640 --> 07:41.220
<i>The students of Class F then began 
their harsh training under Seiichi.</i>

07:50.680 --> 07:55.200
<i>Some time passed, and finally, it was 
the eve of the class competition.</i>

07:58.180 --> 08:00.520
I'm beat.

08:01.040 --> 08:05.960
I know I'm the one who said it, 
but do you really think we can win?

08:05.960 --> 08:07.850
We've done everything we can.

08:07.850 --> 08:09.880
Now we just have to have faith.

08:16.270 --> 08:18.850
He hides his head, 
but leaves himself exposed...

08:18.850 --> 08:23.140
Rumor has it he's super beautiful 
underneath that bear head.

08:25.770 --> 08:27.010
For real?

08:27.010 --> 08:29.090
I thought it was just the same.

08:29.090 --> 08:30.190
The same?

08:30.190 --> 08:31.660
It's like this, right?

08:32.570 --> 08:33.250
Hello.

08:33.250 --> 08:34.610
Oh, that.

08:42.960 --> 08:45.120
Oh, you guys are here, too?

08:45.120 --> 08:47.410
I-It's Class S!

08:49.900 --> 08:52.410
Oh, no! Maitting!

08:52.410 --> 08:53.970
Flop!

08:59.080 --> 09:02.450
I'm the type to wash left hand first!

09:04.000 --> 09:05.470
Helen-chan!

09:05.470 --> 09:06.430
What?

09:06.430 --> 09:08.460
Want me to help you?

09:09.710 --> 09:11.940
Huh?!

09:14.240 --> 09:17.910
I'm sorry for all this. 
I know you're tired from training, too.

09:17.910 --> 09:19.050
It's fine.

09:20.030 --> 09:23.270
I do feel bad about it.

09:23.270 --> 09:24.040
Huh?

09:24.450 --> 09:29.210
Unlike Seiichi-sensei, 
I wasn't any help to you all.

09:32.500 --> 09:36.550
We were able to work so hard because you 
were there for us, Beatrice-sensei.

09:36.550 --> 09:37.560
Huh?

09:38.800 --> 09:40.130
Watch us.

09:40.130 --> 09:42.080
We'll be sure to win tomorrow.

09:43.610 --> 09:44.990
Yes.

09:44.990 --> 09:47.800
I have faith that you all can do it.

09:49.790 --> 09:54.740
And after all that, tomorrow 
is the class competition!

10:04.370 --> 10:07.790
Oh, gosh! So cute!

10:07.790 --> 10:11.170
Hey, now, just how many 
outfits do you intend to buy?

10:11.170 --> 10:14.950
I can't help it. 
Anything I wear looks good on me.

10:14.950 --> 10:16.090
Good grief.

10:16.090 --> 10:18.440
It really does look good on you.

10:18.440 --> 10:19.660
Right?

10:20.720 --> 10:22.850
Wh-Who are you?

10:22.850 --> 10:24.180
Hey, so...

10:24.180 --> 10:27.280
Which tasted better, the chocolate 
parfait, the strawberry parfait,

10:27.280 --> 10:30.020
or the matcha parfait?

10:30.020 --> 10:33.190
<i>I didn't even notice him!</i>

10:33.190 --> 10:35.170
Why are you here?!

10:41.500 --> 10:44.180
Do your job already, would you?

10:44.180 --> 10:46.450
If you're sloppy with your work,

10:46.450 --> 10:48.920
you won't get any more chances.

10:49.960 --> 10:51.260
You'll disappear.

10:52.830 --> 10:54.800
R-Right.

10:58.670 --> 10:59.730
Later, then.

10:59.730 --> 11:01.220
I'm counting on you two.

11:06.210 --> 11:07.670
L-Let's go!

11:07.670 --> 11:09.220
R-Right.

11:19.700 --> 11:28.370
Now, Barbador Magic Academy's 
class competition will commence!

11:44.170 --> 11:49.680
Our first match will be the group 
battle between Class S and Class F!

11:50.500 --> 11:52.810
This will be an elimination match,

11:52.810 --> 11:57.010
and the loser will be the first team 
to have all of its members defeated.

11:57.010 --> 12:01.680
In addition, after this match, win or lose,

12:01.680 --> 12:04.490
all conflict will be forbidden.

12:05.910 --> 12:07.780
Seiichi-sensei?

12:11.250 --> 12:12.750
<b>Gruuumble</b>

12:13.050 --> 12:16.270
I think the bakudan Lulune 
gave me isn't sitting well.

12:19.210 --> 12:21.420
Seiichi, are you all right?

12:21.420 --> 12:22.810
I'm not all right.

12:22.050 --> 12:23.960
The match is starting.

12:23.500 --> 12:24.890
I know!

12:25.700 --> 12:28.590
Now for the first match!

12:28.590 --> 12:30.060
Vanguards, step forward!

12:30.060 --> 12:33.940
I'm the only one we'll need 
to deal with these nobodies.

12:36.360 --> 12:38.320
Hey, you gonna be okay?

12:39.410 --> 12:41.230
You're worried about me?

12:41.230 --> 12:43.420
A-As if I'm worried!

12:43.860 --> 12:45.910
Get the hell out there and crush him quick!

12:45.910 --> 12:47.120
<b>Win</b>

12:53.270 --> 12:54.980
<i>Let's go ahead and see</i>

12:54.980 --> 12:57.290
<i>what this supposed potential 
of the failures is.</i>

12:57.290 --> 12:59.500
Begin!

13:05.210 --> 13:06.930
Wh-Wh-What is this?!

13:06.930 --> 13:08.150
Principal!

13:08.890 --> 13:11.340
Ah, but this is great! This tightness!

13:12.920 --> 13:13.790
Huh?

13:13.790 --> 13:16.560
Yes! Yes!

13:14.390 --> 13:18.100
What is that perverted old man 
doing, getting turned on?!

13:16.560 --> 13:18.100
I love it! Squeeze tighter!

13:24.170 --> 13:25.150
Who's there?!

13:26.250 --> 13:27.950
Good day to you.

13:27.950 --> 13:32.010
I'm Angrea, an apostle 
of the Great Devil Order.

13:32.010 --> 13:33.720
I'm Demioros, of the same.

13:35.100 --> 13:37.250
The Great Devil Order?!

13:45.590 --> 13:47.260
Quiet!

13:49.300 --> 13:51.560
Our apologies for the sudden intrusion,

13:51.560 --> 13:53.930
but we'll need all of you to die.

13:54.770 --> 13:56.210
What does she mean by that?

13:56.210 --> 13:58.730
Huh? What's that bitch saying?

13:59.150 --> 14:03.440
You need only keep quiet and become 
sacrifices to the Great Devil.

14:09.980 --> 14:10.940
What?

14:10.940 --> 14:11.800
What is this?

14:11.800 --> 14:13.850
A wall of light? Some spell?

14:13.850 --> 14:14.720
The exit's blocked!

14:14.720 --> 14:16.250
Now we can't escape!

14:24.920 --> 14:26.170
Help!

14:26.170 --> 14:28.010
Do something about this!

14:28.010 --> 14:31.180
Everyone, settle down and remain calm!

14:31.180 --> 14:32.820
<i>This is advanced light magic.</i>

14:32.820 --> 14:35.430
<i>And they deployed it in an instant!</i>

14:36.230 --> 14:39.390
My, my, this is looking good.

14:41.470 --> 14:43.860
They're not allowed to leave.

14:43.860 --> 14:49.140
You will all fall into the pits 
of despair and then die.

14:49.780 --> 14:53.350
You're a rude pair, showing up unannounced.

14:53.350 --> 14:56.200
Trespassers like you ought to—

14:57.370 --> 14:59.150
And what will you do to us?

15:00.920 --> 15:03.130
Kneel before me!

15:14.550 --> 15:16.970
What a violent welcome.

15:26.130 --> 15:27.860
Now, go forth,

15:27.860 --> 15:30.320
my cute minions.

15:32.470 --> 15:34.370
What are you guys doing?!

15:35.780 --> 15:40.830
Murder Princess, the power to 
manipulate your targets at will.

15:40.830 --> 15:42.290
It's truly delightful.

15:43.290 --> 15:44.420
Brother!

15:46.170 --> 15:47.340
Don't interfere!

15:47.340 --> 15:48.940
I don't need help from my little brother!

15:48.940 --> 15:50.010
But...

15:50.010 --> 15:52.320
What beautiful sibling love.

15:53.200 --> 15:57.410
Though, I wonder how much longer 
you can keep putting up that front.

15:57.410 --> 15:58.780
How dare you?!

15:58.780 --> 16:01.770
I am the next Emperor of the Kaiser Empire!

16:02.110 --> 16:05.520
Oh, my! Then if you two were to die,

16:05.520 --> 16:08.800
it would cause great despair 
within your people.

16:09.330 --> 16:12.680
In that case, please die at once!

16:22.660 --> 16:25.040
They were wide open!

16:25.040 --> 16:26.980
I'm sorry, everyone.

16:26.980 --> 16:28.960
So what do we do now?

16:29.510 --> 16:31.920
Brother, we should work together for now.

16:31.920 --> 16:32.840
Huh?!

16:33.300 --> 16:35.760
The power those two 
possess is extraordinary.

16:35.760 --> 16:39.590
If we want to save the academy, 
 we have to work together!

16:39.590 --> 16:41.680
Helen, just for now, please!

16:47.700 --> 16:49.520
You be the one to give orders.

16:49.520 --> 16:51.310
Once we send these two packing,

16:51.310 --> 16:53.860
let's get right back to the class competition!

16:58.350 --> 16:59.700
Do as you please.

16:59.700 --> 17:00.650
All right.

17:00.650 --> 17:01.970
Let's go, everyone!

17:13.550 --> 17:14.700
Naïve.

17:21.220 --> 17:22.930
It's a king's duty

17:22.930 --> 17:25.390
to take down the enemy leaders!

17:30.230 --> 17:33.810
You're paying the price for 
using your friends as decoys,

17:33.810 --> 17:36.280
little Kaiser Emperor.

17:37.430 --> 17:39.040
Fool.

17:42.490 --> 17:46.320
You used defense magic, 
assuming you'd be attacked?!

17:46.930 --> 17:47.830
Now!

18:11.530 --> 18:14.340
Oh, boy. It came off.

18:16.650 --> 18:18.580
How dare you...

18:20.950 --> 18:22.910
You damn brats?!

18:23.370 --> 18:25.870
You've done it now!

18:25.870 --> 18:28.020
Now that you've seen my bare face,

18:28.020 --> 18:30.460
none of you bastards are getting out alive!

18:30.840 --> 18:33.290
All of you can burn,

18:33.290 --> 18:35.550
you damn scum!

18:38.420 --> 18:39.300
Agnos!

18:39.300 --> 18:41.180
You, too!

18:42.320 --> 18:44.640
Wh-What is this power?!

18:45.640 --> 18:47.560
Why, you!

18:47.560 --> 18:50.500
Shut up, dumbass!

18:53.230 --> 18:55.360
You're annoying!

18:59.730 --> 19:03.740
That mask hides both Angrea's face

19:03.740 --> 19:08.120
and the true power sleeping within her body.

19:08.460 --> 19:12.540
Her flames were born when 
she first burned her own face.

19:12.540 --> 19:15.660
They're the fires of hell, 
cursing everything.

19:23.310 --> 19:26.610
You have an awfully pretty face, don't you?

19:30.190 --> 19:32.980
Good grief, there she goes again.

19:33.970 --> 19:37.400
Seeing a pretty face like yours...

19:37.400 --> 19:41.340
makes me want to ruin it!

19:47.310 --> 19:48.240
Huh?!

19:51.870 --> 19:56.090
I won't let you lay a hand 
on my students any longer!

19:56.090 --> 19:57.960
Beatrice-sensei...

19:57.960 --> 19:58.670
Tsk.

20:00.350 --> 20:05.200
<i>Surprisingly, Beatrice-san is 
the one to stand up to Angrea!</i>

20:05.900 --> 20:11.310
<i>Will she be able to beat the apostles 
of the Great Devil Order?!</i>

20:12.440 --> 20:14.320
<i>And will Seiichi...</i>

20:14.990 --> 20:17.360
Hey, you still in there?

20:17.360 --> 20:19.610
True: Get Better!

20:17.360 --> 20:21.030
<b>True: Get Better</b>

20:19.110 --> 20:20.530
<b>Gruuumble</b>

20:21.030 --> 20:23.490
It's not working!

20:23.490 --> 20:27.990
By the way, this spell is the evolution 
of "Get Better" from the first season!

21:57.960 --> 22:02.630
While the students of Class F 
were fighting a terrifying foe...

22:02.630 --> 22:06.550
Seiichi was also fighting 
his own terrifying battle!

22:08.820 --> 22:10.970
Seiichi, are you all right?

22:10.970 --> 22:12.740
I'm not all right!

22:10.970 --> 22:13.210
Onii-chan, is your stomach feeling better?

22:13.210 --> 22:14.540
I might be done for.

22:14.540 --> 22:17.450
Then Oliga-chan and I will cure you!

22:17.450 --> 22:19.780
Yeah! I want to help you, Onii-chan!

22:19.780 --> 22:21.180
Thank you!

22:21.180 --> 22:22.950
But how will you do it?

22:22.950 --> 22:26.990
I've heard it's important to hydrate 
when you have an upset stomach.

22:26.990 --> 22:27.590
Huh?

22:27.590 --> 22:28.590
There!

22:30.820 --> 22:32.260
How's that, Seiichi?

22:32.260 --> 22:33.690
Achoo!

22:33.690 --> 22:35.610
Stupid Saria!

22:35.610 --> 22:38.610
You made him cold, and now 
his stomach's hurting again.

22:38.610 --> 22:39.970
Huh?

22:39.970 --> 22:41.970
Saria-san!

22:41.970 --> 22:45.190
I've heard that stress isn't good 
for the stomach, either.

22:45.190 --> 22:48.240
Let's meditate to calm his emotions.

22:48.240 --> 22:50.500
Let's meditate.

22:52.550 --> 22:54.930
Wait, this could cause a broadcast crash!

22:54.930 --> 22:57.210
Oh, if you get too angry...

22:57.210 --> 22:59.280
Oh, no!

22:59.850 --> 23:03.190
Now that I think about it, 
didn't we have some stomach medicine?

23:03.190 --> 23:05.390
Say that sooner!

23:06.780 --> 23:08.130
Whew, you saved me.

23:08.130 --> 23:09.300
Thank you, Saria.

23:09.300 --> 23:10.690
You're welcome.

23:10.690 --> 23:12.820
Huh? It's not working at all!

23:12.820 --> 23:15.600
Is the medicine you just took 
a laxative, by chance?

23:15.600 --> 23:16.930
You're right!

23:16.930 --> 23:18.640
It says "laxative" on it!

23:18.640 --> 23:20.580
I'm so done!

23:20.580 --> 23:22.770
I can't even show my face!

23:22.770 --> 23:24.360
Why is this happening?!

23:24.360 --> 23:27.420
Oh, it's coming out! It's really coming out!

23:26.570 --> 23:32.150
<i>And so Seiichi's battle will 
continue until next week!</i>

23:27.950 --> 23:30.000
Oh, it's really coming out!

23:32.150 --> 23:33.630
<i>To be continued!</i>

23:32.150 --> 23:34.970
Oh, no! We're all out of time!

